Table full name: bigquery-public-data.cms_medicare.home_health_agencies_2014
Column name: provider_id Type: STRING Description: The 6-digit identification number for the home health agency on the claim.
Column name: agency_name Type: STRING Description: The home health agency name, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: street_address Type: STRING Description: The home health agency address, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: city Type: STRING Description: The city where the home health agency is located, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: state Type: STRING Description: The state where the home health agency is located, as reported in POS file. The fifty U.S. states and the District of Columbia are reported by the state postal abbreviation.
Column name: zip_code Type: INT64 Description: The home health agency’s zip code, as reported in the POS file.
Column name: total_episodes_non_lupa Type: INT64 Description: Total count of non-LUPA episodes provided by a specific home health agency or in a unique HHRG category in the calendar year.
Column name: distinct_beneficiaries_non_lupa Type: INT64 Description: Number of distinct Medicare beneficiaries receiving at least one non-LUPA home health episode in the calendar year. Beneficiaries may receive multiple home health episodes per year but are only counted once in this field.
Column name: average_number_of_total_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of total visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_skilled_nursing_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of skilled nursing visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_pt_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of physical therapy visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_ot_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of occupational therapy visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_st_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of speech therapy visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_home_health_aide_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of home health aide visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: average_number_of_medical_social_visits_per_episode_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average number of medical-social visits provided by the HHA during a non-LUPA episode.
Column name: total_hha_charge_amount_non_lupa Type: INT64 Description: Total charges that the home health agency submitted for non-LUPA episodes.
Column name: total_hha_medicare_payment_amount_non_lupa Type: INT64 Description: Total amount that Medicare paid for non-LUPA episodes. Home health services do not have any cost-sharing requirements and the Medicare payment amount will equal the allowed amount.
Column name: total_hha_medicare_standard_payment_amount_non_lupa Type: INT64 Description: Total amount that Medicare paid for non-LUPA episodes adjusted for geographic differences in payment rates.
Column name: outlier_payments_as_a_percent_of_medicare_payment_amount_non_lupa Type: FLOAT64 Description: The percent of total Medicare payments for non-LUPA episodes paid to an HHA for outlier episodes.
Column name: total_lupa_episodes Type: INT64 Description: Total count of low utilization payment amount episodes provided by a specific HHA in the calendar year.
Column name: total_hha_medicare_payment_amount_for_lupas Type: INT64 Description: Total amount that Medicare paid for LUPA episodes provided by a specific HHA in the calendar year.
Column name: average_age Type: INT64 Description: Average age of beneficiaries. Beneficiary age is calculated at the end of the calendar year or at the time of death.
Column name: male_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of male beneficiaries.
Column name: female_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of female beneficiaries.
Column name: nondual_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of Medicare beneficiaries qualified to receive Medicare only benefits. Beneficiaries are classified as Medicare only entitlement if they received zero months of any Medicaid benefits (full or partial) in the given calendar year.
Column name: dua_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of Medicare beneficiaries qualified to receive Medicare and Medicaid benefits. Beneficiaries are classified as Medicare and Medicaid entitlement if in any month in the given calendar year they were receiving full or partial Medicaid benefits.
Column name: white_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of non-Hispanic white beneficiaries.
Column name: black_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of non-Hispanic black or African American beneficiaries.
Column name: asian_pacific_islander_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of Asian Pacific Islander beneficiaries.
Column name: hispanic_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of Hispanic beneficiaries.
Column name: american_indian_or_alaska_native_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of American Indian or Alaska Native beneficiaries.
Column name: other_unknown_beneficiaries Type: INT64 Description: Number of beneficiaries with race not elsewhere classified.
Column name: average_hcc_score Type: FLOAT64 Description: Average Hierarchical Condition Category (HCC) risk score of beneficiaries. Please refer to the “Additional Information” section of the Methodology document for more details on HCC risk scores.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_atrial_fibrillation Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for atrial fibrillation.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_alzheimers Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for Alzheimer’s, related disorders, or dementia.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_asthma Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for Asthma.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_cancer Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithms for cancer. Includes breast cancer, colorectal cancer, lung cancer and prostate cancer.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_chf Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for heart failure.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_chronic_kidney_disease Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for chronic kidney disease.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_copd Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for chronic obstructive pulmonary disease.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_depression Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for depression.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_diabetes Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for diabetes.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_hyperlipidemia Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for hyperlipidemia.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_hypertension Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for hypertension.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_ihd Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for ischemic heart disease.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_osteoporosis Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for osteoporosis.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_ra_oa Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for rheumatoid arthritis/osteoarthritis.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_schizophrenia Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders.
Column name: percent_of_beneficiaries_with_stroke Type: INT64 Description: Percent of beneficiaries meeting the CCW chronic condition algorithm for stroke.
